WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.098
Week 1: How Spanish Works. spell a name recognize a stressed syllable build a sustainable study loop

2
00:00:07.098 --> 00:00:15.049
Mission brief. Record a twenty-second introduction, spell your name, and identify the stressed syllable in five words.

3
00:00:15.049 --> 00:00:24.731
Preparation. Select ten useful words, three linking expressions, and two repair phrases. Plan points rather than a memorized paragraph.

4
00:00:24.731 --> 00:00:32.875
Performance. Complete the task once for fluency, review the evidence, then repeat it for greater clarity and accuracy.

5
00:00:32.875 --> 00:00:41.658
After-action review. Record what succeeded, what blocked communication, and the single change that will matter most on the next attempt.

6
00:00:41.658 --> 00:01:10.412
Model language. Voy a grabar mi presentación. — I am going to record my introduction. Identifico la sílaba tónica en cada palabra. — I identify the stressed syllable in each word. Corrijo un error a la vez. — I correct one mistake at a time. Mi meta es mejorar cada semana. — My goal is to improve every week. Reviso el resultado de mi primer intento. — I review the result of my first attempt.

7
00:01:10.412 --> 00:01:20.417
Check your readiness. Explain the core idea. Produce an original example. Complete the section assessment at 85% or higher.
